Package: Friedman
Title: Tools for Exploring Florida Crime and Demographic Patterns
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Diego", "Narvaez", email = "diego.narvaez@usf.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: 
    This package provides exploratory and visualization tools for analyzing 
    Florida crime and demographic datasets. It includes functions for data 
    cleaning, clustering, mapping, and statistical modeling to reveal 
    relationships between location, income, and crime types.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr, tidyr, leaflet
License: CC0
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/diegonarvaez/Friedman
BugReports: https://github.com/diegonarvaez/Friedman/issues
